            <div xml:id="m-d2af627f-1967-44cb-bbaa-67893e4ae497">
              <lg xml:id="m-33db2b37-1e78-40cb-81f7-d89722c54dae">
                <l xml:id="m-6b78736d-10d8-495f-86d9-11b93f501466" facs="#m-50196fea-b716-4f89-be29-8012eaab8ebb" label="ambiguous">whit Monday.</l><l xml:id="m-41265408-bf3f-4fe2-9e8c-dd39e0141e42" facs="#m-9ad21316-45bb-4546-b454-6c38907221f8" label="ambiguous">sss</l><l xml:id="m-4148d359-46a4-4847-b9c2-2ae5046c99e1" facs="#m-f5a45f31-833f-45b1-9c46-91dffa147f99" label="lyrics-like">satu-rá-vit é-os, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-774586d0-c1f3-49a6-84cd-8933f038cf02" facs="#m-16411788-806c-4d57-ba5d-668a37cf60f0" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia: et de pé-tra, mélle</l><l xml:id="m-e6a5181c-a9d4-4337-9262-98a38dfa7afb" facs="#m-85d9c432-b46d-4f8d-a420-84479e0dd4df" label="lyrics-like">ia. Ps. Exsultá¬</l><l xml:id="m-bdb247bd-aeb3-47f7-a31f-83180821c221" facs="#m-948b43ea-6655-4a09-a89b-042910660933" label="lyrics-like">lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-505166f8-20df-429a-b2b1-c8518b296cf0" facs="#m-02fb6dbd-e199-4d41-b726-18f14e665d95" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia, al-le-lú- ia, al-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ea5658c-3a40-4fbf-a281-3b443f1b9fc1" facs="#m-6eefff57-e553-49ae-9368-38aa032cdc36" label="lyrics-like">te Dé-o adju-tó-ri nóstro:“ju-bi-lá-te Dé-o Já-cob.</l><l xml:id="m-2c5e0a33-68c2-413f-917a-bfc7933f0ba0" facs="#m-00bf0e48-a6ce-4c6f-a777-242205f2ea51" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-3fb73f75-b3d0-43d0-b7e2-b79b7aa3e108" facs="#m-53944674-8934-496a-8e5b-5b4921cefe82" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-2652d569-2e22-4859-a610-effa8c7ea3ff" facs="#m-cbc7c755-5ad2-4150-b3f6-4e71a0266806" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui Apóstolis tuis Sanctum l ut quibus dedisti fidem, largiáris et</l><l xml:id="m-253bbb0c-a29c-48b8-af5d-b1be08fdab79" facs="#m-662cf43b-b95c-4cc2-8ce2-8ce390dac165" label="lyrics-like">O dedisti Spiritum:t concéde</l><l xml:id="m-7434c8fd-2b03-48ab-b2e8-04bab2109272" facs="#m-a81cdeb1-e2d3-4a2d-afdb-d35b6f37e06b" label="lyrics-like">pacem. Per Dóminum... in unitáte</l><l xml:id="m-acee07f9-013f-4489-9265-0b5738367c74" facs="#m-68e7fcf6-1f0b-45f1-8e5f-e183c8e19b38" label="lyrics-like">plebi tuae piae petitiónis efféctum:*lejúsdem Spiritus.</l><l xml:id="m-c2c77770-69cd-4569-b2cf-9de0ed7ea581" facs="#m-3a5dab46-2e3f-4fc8-adf9-f6326b72d7c3" label="ambiguous">Lectio Actuum Apostolorum. Act. 10. f.</l><l xml:id="m-83fc3447-202b-4fa4-bc0b-f7d6460a3514" facs="#m-9afc1a34-78c5-4753-b098-49806eaa3433" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Apériens Petrus</l><l xml:id="m-5ea278e3-4324-48bf-8c07-fd03e770fb85" facs="#m-ffdf2bf2-e7c5-4703-8453-3aca955f90a6" label="lyrics-like">Et obstupuérunt ex circumcisióne</l><l xml:id="m-eb1e2bcb-50bf-4208-8c60-ddd41967b732" facs="#m-87367c35-32fe-486d-8915-5e6de1106349" label="ambiguous">Los suum, dixit: Viri fratres. no¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5f8aa0b-1eb4-44dc-844c-e995302bfc10" facs="#m-a36432ca-2dd2-4ee0-9e1b-001773a490e7" label="lyrics-like">fidéles, qui vénerant cum Petro:</l><l xml:id="m-798cbf60-ac90-4309-8bcf-76b0deee014b" facs="#m-f3964e52-c5bc-486d-b001-dff6429ab4be" label="lyrics-like">bis praecépit Dóminus praedicáre</l><l xml:id="m-d7f9f4b2-da36-49b6-86de-f6f3d1832b40" facs="#m-001967ae-7098-4e58-a553-22a7f8100cee" label="lyrics-like">quia et in natiónes grátia Spiritus</l><l xml:id="m-95e244db-fc3c-4bb5-8fe3-6c29a8f0a4ce" facs="#m-c7aafca7-f258-47ec-8cd8-5401e4b33ced" label="lyrics-like">pópulo: et testificári, quia ipse est,</l><l xml:id="m-c110c10c-64f9-499f-991e-e4cbaa60171c" facs="#m-9386ca4b-8c18-421a-9433-593b6e1479c2" label="lyrics-like">Sancti effúsa est. Audiébant enim</l><l xml:id="m-46aecd3e-44b3-49bc-9e55-e3078fc4169d" facs="#m-094cd312-89de-433f-9656-9df7513aacc6" label="lyrics-like">illos loquéntes linguis, et magnifi¬</l><l xml:id="m-07a49d4e-f0da-4dd0-be2d-c9ff1878fb66" facs="#m-df10310b-d3ac-425d-9eda-f1ce68a7dc22" label="lyrics-like">qui constitútus est a Deo judex vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-62c357b6-d362-4033-91c1-cfaca0782729" facs="#m-d7f6d445-39d6-46a6-b1e6-d7ed6f8fed29" label="lyrics-like">vórum et mortuórum. Huic omnes</l><l xml:id="m-05075d50-0df6-40c0-9060-b21c8dd159be" facs="#m-b09844d2-8f7a-4aa7-8898-2fd4a915851e" label="lyrics-like">cántes Deum. Tunc respóndit Pe¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d49c12a-ae6b-48f0-a02d-684e4ac89fe6" facs="#m-243d9d89-a50a-4706-b9ac-b3cb2da71a7b" label="lyrics-like">Prophétae testimónium pérhibent,</l><l xml:id="m-a4b781c2-5b51-485e-b0bc-d004b987508d" facs="#m-491af11d-05b3-402a-ad4f-2b357ff2c52a" label="ambiguous">trus: Numquid aquam quis prohi¬</l><l xml:id="m-a7f7f171-f0f2-4356-a2c9-945b69c6e9de" facs="#m-da5e2dd0-2290-46ec-8637-63d0b3d721b1" label="lyrics-like">remissiónem peccatórum accspere</l><l xml:id="m-07da7ad5-0fe4-4aae-8c88-b27c8e8e4f2e" facs="#m-0f8a6236-54c8-4b10-91ef-530895a729bb" label="lyrics-like">bére potest, ut non baptizéntur hi,</l><l xml:id="m-bca14b94-820e-4a21-bd76-3e3f0a9eebd5" facs="#m-592aab2d-1ecc-4347-bc14-e78c631aea24" label="lyrics-like">qui Spiritum Sanctum accepérunt</l><l xml:id="m-2f44eee4-6480-4ac1-b857-e30dbbc4ad24" facs="#m-57a41948-d3f9-4b59-99af-aebb179ab6c8" label="ambiguous">per nomen ejus omnes, qui credunt</l><l xml:id="m-8f8bc454-5a5a-42cc-9178-825727cee28a" facs="#m-b3c6886a-4254-41ad-ad0a-c36d5dc5eede" label="lyrics-like">in eum. Adhuc loquénte Petro ver¬</l><l xml:id="m-79d35457-4b34-4fd2-9601-3b571290049c" facs="#m-3eb12916-1c99-4d41-97eb-68420edce66a" label="lyrics-like">sicut et nos? Et jussit eos baptizári</l><l xml:id="m-dafe45d5-cb37-450b-bcc2-8ff534f74b02" facs="#m-188d8a70-01e2-453c-9109-ecfa68402c4f" label="lyrics-like">ba hæc, cécidit Spiritus Sanctus</l><l xml:id="m-72db6cde-fcc8-40f5-8843-6e438ed512fd" facs="#m-f5b973e6-3472-4e64-aa4c-8b118a98faa9" label="lyrics-like">in nómine Dómini Jesu Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-c465c029-d542-4b37-994c-799c1c69e493" facs="#m-bd79b888-119f-4f04-a1bb-9f0d8105cda1" label="lyrics-like">super omnes, qui audiébant verbum.</l><l xml:id="m-46ad066f-31f4-4c84-9746-c89e84757a36" facs="#m-a066c9ac-5297-4a33-8e00-b35b96fb5cc9" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-f49958a0-f953-4e24-825e-aa702764e668" facs="#m-d177678c-f334-47bc-b2b4-b79f7736137c" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-09e03999-3559-497b-b188-5caefcbe696c" facs="#m-d26e1d18-70b7-41f9-9ca0-b434b21d1931" label="ambiguous">ij</l><l xml:id="m-e86e03ed-7d02-4b09-bf14-e900bf282e10" facs="#m-18f04f50-37e2-48a2-a0b2-5fcb2e02955f" label="ambiguous">Lle¬</l><l xml:id="m-a872d199-c73f-4fd0-9efc-0a5decbc0009" facs="#m-08b38909-70c8-4169-abc4-ddd9ebe3f43f" label="lyrics-like">lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-ee5a408b-cb6a-4ab1-9318-4fb4547a5620" facs="#m-db7af4a0-f0c9-4254-b852-fd31fd104601" label="lyrics-like">V. Lo¬ quebán¬</l><l xml:id="m-302c3f3a-3d18-437c-a50e-2dd16158fd71" facs="#m-badfc553-6280-4716-a5fb-c7a917bcce66" label="text-like">is</l><l xml:id="m-3d0bce85-3e3c-48ce-8c58-72bb0cd4dc6a" facs="#m-c9255f36-4c84-4e09-ad5d-7b31adb03eb3" label="lyrics-like">vá¬ ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-f0a3bd25-f374-4ee1-8c3f-57bff9675558" facs="#m-b30763cb-707c-43bb-87e9-f04ed8a1db53" label="ambiguous">tur</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
